    {
      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Row-Haan and this video is about how Bluetooth audio works: how music gets from your phone to wireless earbuds, and why it sometimes lags or cuts out. I built a small version to see how.",
