      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "LIP SYNC",
      "narration_text": "Real earbuds are often a couple of hundred milliseconds behind. For videos, the headphones can report that delay, and the phone holds the picture back to match. A game can't hold back your button presses, so games can feel laggy.",
