      "narration_text": "Bluetooth's next generation, LE Audio, brings a new codec called LC3. The Bluetooth SIG says it beats SBC even at half the bit rate. Its broadcast feature, Auracast, lets one phone or TV stream to any number of earbuds nearby.",
